{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>WETTOP</strong> is a thrilling parkour adventure where <strong>every step matters</strong>.<br>Climb, jump, and sprint your way through a vertical world filled with floating platforms, dangerous gaps, and unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with <strong>10 shared lives</strong> \u2014 make them count.<br>One mistake can cost you, and once the lives are gone\u2026 it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple controls, but challenging paths.<br>Every level demands precision timing, smart movement, and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Face <strong>mini tasks and puzzles</strong> along the way to unlock checkpoints or gain an edge.<br>From pressure pads to leap-of-faith jumps, each challenge keeps you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a foggy mountain landscape, WETTOP brings a mysterious, dream-like vibe.<br>Watch clouds move around you as you climb toward the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Only Up</i> but with its own heartbeat-style life system,<br>WETTOP blends tension, beauty, and parkour mechanics into a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a <strong>solo experience</strong> \u2014 no distractions, just you vs the climb.<br>Every fall feels personal, every success feels earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The glowing <strong>10-life heartbeat health bar</strong> keeps you visually connected to survival.<br>Feel your lives pulse with intensity as you progress higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go without falling?<br>Will you conquer WETTOP or run out of time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd7 The climb starts now.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Game Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3798300/21f0a1372f1f096e7b20acfd445cd8acd43043e2.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798300?t=1758427114","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798300/bfd1e285773090e1fc95f2a7da09c168af31873d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758427114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798300/65ebff5cfa35436d84f42fc946a223acf8a9ed04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758427114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798300/65ebff5cfa35436d84f42fc946a223acf8a9ed04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758427114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>WETTOP</strong> is a thrilling parkour adventure where <strong>every step matters</strong>.<br>Climb, jump, and sprint your way through a vertical world filled with floating platforms, dangerous gaps, and unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with <strong>10 shared lives</strong> \u2014 make them count.<br>One mistake can cost you, and once the lives are gone\u2026 it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple controls, but challenging paths.<br>Every level demands precision timing, smart movement, and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Face <strong>mini tasks and puzzles</strong> along the way to unlock checkpoints or gain an edge.<br>From pressure pads to leap-of-faith jumps, each challenge keeps you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a foggy mountain landscape, WETTOP brings a mysterious, dream-like vibe.<br>Watch clouds move around you as you climb toward the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Only Up</i> but with its own heartbeat-style life system,<br>WETTOP blends tension, beauty, and parkour mechanics into a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a <strong>solo experience</strong> \u2014 no distractions, just you vs the climb.<br>Every fall feels personal, every success feels earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The glowing <strong>10-life heartbeat health bar</strong> keeps you visually connected to survival.<br>Feel your lives pulse with intensity as you progress higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go without falling?<br>Will you conquer WETTOP or run out of time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd7 The climb starts now.</p>","developers":["SIMPLE THINK GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798300/ee00ae401c069b121210a1ea75d0be56f755e0e1/header.jpg?t=1758427114","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3798300/760296759/6cc15d7933d2ab2cb21de5281c216375bbcfb4be/1750498046/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751084157","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3798300/760296759/6cc15d7933d2ab2cb21de5281c216375bbcfb4be/1750498046/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751084157","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/379